cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the research behind it, please cite the relevant preprint or dataset below."
title: "Rankfor Open"
abstract: >-
  Open-science tools and datasets for measuring AI visibility: whether large
  language models name a brand, which sources they ground that answer in, and
  how much of the answer is noise.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Żatuchin"
    given-names: "Dmitrij"
    affiliation: "Rankfor.AI"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Rankfor/rankfor-open"
url: "https://open.rankfor.ai"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - ai-visibility
  - answer-engine-optimization
  - generative-engine-optimization
  - brand-monitoring
  - large-language-models

